<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.2">
<l>calampoti yuṭampiṉ taḻalumiḻ pēḻvāyc cantiraṉ veṅkati rañca</l>
<l>malarnteḻun taṇavu maṇivaṇṇa vuruviṉ mālpuru ṭōttamaṉ vāḻvu</l>
<l>nalantikaḻ caṭaiyāṉ muṭikkoṉṟai malarum nāraṇaṉ pātattu ḻāyuṅ</l>
<l>kalantiḻi puṉalāl pukarpaṭu kaṅkaik kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The residence of Māl Puruṣottama,</l>
<l rend="indent">whose jewel-toned form arose and bloomed,</l>
<l>approaching so that [he] frightened the moon</l>
<l rend="indent">with a body that stores water,</l>
<l>and the hot sun with a maw that spits fire,</l>
<l rend="indent">is the protected city called Kaṇṭam</l>
<l>[on the banks] of the beautiful Ganges,</l>
<l rend="indent">with waters that fall,</l>
<l>mixing the koṉṟai blossoms</l>
<l rend="indent">from the head of [Śiva’s] red, shining, matted locks,</l>
<l>[with] the tulasi from the feet of Nāraṇa.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
